SUMMARY:Alpaca Open House/Homegrown Hay Days
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a fun day on the Alpaca Farm\, we offer a free hay ride\, walk an alpaca\, play on the hay tower\, a tot lot for those little ones in your family\, and for a small fee\, feed an alpaca\, food available for purchase. On the 25+ acre farm you can visit with a variety of animals such as: Charlie the Texas longhorn\, beef cattle\, pigs\, and birds\, you just never know what we will have at the alpaca farm for you to see. Yearly event 2nd weekend of October. Saturday is 9am to 4pm and Sunday is 10am to 4pm.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/alpaca-open-house-homegrown-hay-days/18775/
END:VEVENT
