SUMMARY:The YAAC Show
DESCRIPTION:The YAAC Show is every other Friday. A LIVE talk show produced by the creative team at the Y Arts Center. Join us for an evening of inspiration\, entertainment\, and community connection—powered by the YMCA’s Arts and Humanities initiatives. Every other Friday at 6:30pm. $10 at the door. Free for YMCA Members. Check IG @y_arts_center for interview and musical guest information.
