BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgevent20thanniversaryparty26polishheritagecelebration26159-20261010@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261009T165624Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
SUMMARY:20th Anniversary Party & Polish Heritage Celebration
DESCRIPTION:It's our 20th birthday and we want to party! Orchid Cellar opened back in October 2006 in Montgomery County before migrating to Middletown in 2009 and\, finally\, building our current\, log cabin tasting room in 2014. That's 20 whole years of making delicious mead in Maryland! It's also Polish American Heritage Month and\, if you know anything about us\, you know that we are a Polish family making mead the way our ancestors did - traditional recipes honoring the meads of Eastern Europe. To celebrate these two great events\, we'll have: -pierogi from Punk 'N Peasant (12pm to 4pm or until sold out) -Polish pottery for sale (12pm to 5pm) -fun animal encounters from Jenn's Uncommon Critters -Polish gifts and holiday items from the Polish Heritage Association of Maryland (become a member!) -live music by Ken Demith Collection (3pm to 6pm) Mark your calendars! Bonus: It's the perfect time of year to visit the meadery and see the beautiful fall foliage of Middletown Valley!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/20th-anniversary-party-%26-polish-heritage-celebration/26159/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventaveryspookypaintnsip26202-20261010@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261009T165624Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
SUMMARY:A Very Spooky Paint 'n Sip
DESCRIPTION:'Tis the season for cozy\, spooky activities! Frederick based artist\, Nina Harrast\, will be hosting A Very Spooky Paint ’n Sip in our taproom on Saturday\, October 10th! In this 2-hour\, Bob Ross–style class\, Nina will guide you step-by-step in creating your very own Halloween-scene masterpiece. Whether you’ve been painting for years or have never picked up a brush\, this event is designed for everyone. Bring your creativity\, roll up your sleeves\, and get painting! Your ticket includes all materials needed\, along with one full pour of any one of our beers\, NA brews or soft drinks. Limited seats\, so reserve your spot now!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/a-very-spooky-paint-n-sip/26202/
END:VEVENT
