DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
SUMMARY:Alley Nights
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Alley Nights — your Saturday night destination in Downtown Frederick. With three bars open\, the party moves wherever the night takes you! Start in our newly renovated Main Bar\, catch the DJ spinning in Terrace\, or head upstairs to the rooftop bar for drinks and views of downtown Frederick. Add late-night bites\, great music\, and a lively crowd — and you’ve got everything you need for the perfect Saturday night! Benefactor Events joins us every first and third Saturday of the month to get the party going in Terrace! Meet us at Alley Nights! No cover | 21+ event.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/alley-nights/23158/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventautumnreggaewineandmusicfestival20832-20261010@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261009T165624Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
SUMMARY:Autumn Reggae Wine and Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:Cool reggae vibes paired perfectly with your favorite Maryland wines for a fall afternoon unlike any other. At Linganore Winecellars\, we’ve never believed great wine (and great vibes) should come with a rulebook. As one of Maryland’s OG wine pioneers\, we helped shape the local festival industry long before it was trendy. Our philosophy is simple: craft great wine\, price it fairly\, and create memorable experiences you'll want to mark on your calendar months in advance. Our festivals have become the unofficial HQ for reunions\, celebrations\, and those long-overdue “we need to do this more often” moments. Fifty years in\, and we’re still pouring\, still partying\, and still saving you a spot on the dance floor. We've got a lineup that will make you want to party with us all weekend long. (And yes\, those wine-fueled dance moves will end up on our Facebook reels later - we promise you look great). SATURDAY\, OCTOBER 10: DJ Sprang Intl - MC | 10AM-6PM TBD | 11AM-2PM Mighty Joshua | 3PM-6PM SUNDAY\, OCTOBER 11: DJ Sprang Intl - MC | 10AM-6PM TBD | 11AM-2PM Jah Works | 3PM-6PM Customize your experience with your choice of General Admission\, VIP\, Designated Driver\, and Early Access ticket options! General Admission Tickets Include: Access into the festival grounds at 9AM Keepsake 9oz stemmless wine glass for sampling Unlimited sampling of 19 different wines from Linganore Winecellars beginning at 10AM Shopping from over 40+ boutique vendors Live music from 10AM-6PM Bottle sales\, glass sales\, speciality cocktails & drinks available for purchase from 10AM-6PM Cell phone charging stations available on site VIP Tickets Include: All of the perks of General Admission\, plus: Streamlined VIP entry into the festival - no waiting in long lines! Bonus VIP gift in addition to the 9oz keepsake glass Access into the VIP Hall\, which includes air conditioning and indoor restrooms Bonus wine tasting of 6 exclusive wines in the VIP Hall Designated Drivers & Ages 18-20 enjoy discounted tickets\, plus will enjoy their choice of two specialty zero-proof beverages at the festival. Linganore Winecellars offers a number of zero proof options for designated drivers and other non-drinkers to enjoy throughout the event. Early Access Tickets allow ticket holders to enter the festival grounds as early as 6AM. All attendees who wish to enter the grounds at 6AM MUST have an early access ticket type. Early Access ticket holders may exit and re-enter the festival at a later time if they wish. (Yes\, we're okay with you napping in your car. And yes\, we're that excited for the festival too.) There's no shortage of great drinks to be had at the Autumn Reggae Wine & Music Festival! With over 40 wines from Linganore Winecellars\, craft beers from Red Shedman Brewery\, and a handful of seasonal speciality beverages\, you're sure to stay hydrated all day long. Don't miss out on fan favorites like Spiced Apple Wine (served warm on those chilly fall mornings) or Mountain Red (hello\, adult grape juice!). Maybe you're in the mood for something a little drier - may we suggest Seventh Rosé or Retriever Red? Not sure? Hm. Guess you'll just have to come to the festival and try them for yourself.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/autumn-reggae-wine-and-music-festival/20832/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventbloomsandbovines7chighlandcows2bpumpkinfloralcenterpieceevent25730-20261010@visitfrederick
